      "trackName": "2048 No Way",
      "description": "2048 No Way brings the classic number puzzle to your Apple Watch.\n\nMerge matching tiles, build higher numbers, and try to reach 2048 right from your wrist. It is perfect for quick sessions during a break, on the go, or whenever you want a simple brain challenge without opening your phone.\nThe clean interface is designed for the small Apple Watch screen, making every move fast, clear, and easy to play. Think ahead, plan your strategy, and keep improving your score.\n\nFeatures:\nClassic 2048 gameplay\nMade for Apple Watch\nFast puzzle sessions\nSimple and intuitive controls\nNumber puzzle for logic and focus\nGreat for quick brain training\n\n2048 No Way is a tiny puzzle game with a big challenge. Can you reach 2048?",
